0" end="00:45.000">, </span><span begin="00:45.000" end="00:45.360">so </span><span begin="00:45.360" end="00:45.480">I </span><span begin="00:45.480" end="00:45.840">sleep </span><span begin="00:45.840" end="00:46.080">in </span><span begin="00:46.080" end="00:46.140">the </span><span begin="00:46.140" end="00:47.730">basement</span><span begin="00:47.730" end="00:48.120">, </span><span begin="00:48.120" end="00:48.690">making </span><span begin="00:48.690" end="00:48.870">up </span><span begin="00:48.870" end="00:49.380">rap </span><span begin="00:49.380" end="00:49.920">beats</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.220" end="01:01.170"><span begin="00:53.220" end="00:53.640">Hot </span><span begin="00:53.640" end="00:54.060">cup </span><span begin="00:54.060" end="00:54.150">of </span><span begin="00:54.150" end="00:55.230">tea</span><span begin="00:55.230" end="00:55.890">, </span><span begin="00:55.890" end="00:56.070">it's </span><span begin="00:56.070" end="00:56.310">four </span><span begin="00:56.310" end="00:56.850">o'clock </span><span begin="00:56.850" end="00:57.000">in </span><span begin="00:57.000" end="00:57.090">the </span><span begin="00:57.090" end="00:57.480">middle </span><span begin="00:57.480" end="00:57.660">of </span><span begin="00:57.660" end="00:57.750">the </span><span begin="00:57.750" end="00:59.010">night</span><span begin="00:59.010" end="00:59.430">, </span><span begin="00:59.430" end="00:59.670">and </span><span begin="00:59.670" end="00:59.910">I </span><span begin="00:59.910" end="01:00.390">can't </span><span begin="01:00.390" end="01:01.170">sleep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.990" end="01:13.170"><span begin="01:03.990" end="01:04.350">It's </span><span begin="01:04.350" end="01:04.620">all </span><span begin="01:04.620" end="01:04.950">on </span><span begin="01:04.950" end="01:06.690">repeat</span><span begin="01:06.690" end="01:06.720">, </span><span begin="01:06.720" end="01:07.230">so </span><span begin="01:07.